        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: The Fattest Man in Britain\n- People: Caroline Aherne, Jeff Pope, David Blair, Timothy Spall, Bobby Ball, Aisling Loftus, Barry Austin, Robert Harper, Tommy Cannon\n- Broadcasters: ITV, STV, UTV\n- Comedy acts: Cannon and Ball\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Harper, professionally known as Bobby Ball, was born on 28 January 1944 and is an English comedian, actor, and singer.\n- Bobby Ball is best known as one half of the double act Cannon and Ball with Tommy Cannon.\n- The Fattest Man in Britain is a comedy-drama written by Caroline Aherne and Jeff Pope and directed by David Blair.\n- The Fattest Man in Britain aired on ITV, STV, and UTV on 20 December 2009.\n- The Fattest Man in Britain starred Timothy Spall, Bobby Ball, Aisling Loftus, and Barry Austin.",
